<p>Crosslink was suggested by the author for the following reason:</p>
<p>I would imagine this to be something similar to SCP-2273, which ended up in Russia and this implied that it was applied as a weapon of the Russians. I suppose a crosslink can provide a cut Easter egg, since MacLeod (2273's author) originally planned for two instances (an American and a Russian) before only leaving the Russian instance as Alexei.</p>
<p>Editing this:</p>
